               <msContents>
                  <summary>Notebook of <persName key="person_1">Marjory Wardrop</persName>. 
                     Contains drafts of 4 letters in Georgian (to <persName> Olga Chavchavadze</persName> <date when="1909-03-16">3.16.1909</date>; 
                     to Mr. <persName>Avalishvili</persName>, <date from="1909-10-04" to="1909-10-17">4/17.10.09</date>; 
                     to Mr. <persName>Rtskhiladze</persName>, undated; and to <persName>S. P̣irtskhalava</persName>, undated) 
                     and 1 letter in English, to Mr. <persName>Cherkesov</persName>, undated. 
                     Also, short word-list &amp; 2 fragments of Georgian-English translation.
                  </summary>
                  <msItem xml:id="MS_Wardr_e_33-item1" n="1">
                     <author key="person_1"><persName>Wardrop, Marjory</persName></author>                     
                     <title xml:lang="ka-Latn-x-lc" key="work_57">Notebook of Marjory Wardrop</title>                     
                     <textLang mainLang="ka">Georgian and English used for translations of Georgian texts and word-list.</textLang>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
